        "original_id": "0bcf878e-afe3-5c5b-9c99-0c829453decd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dick Purcell, Lorna Gray, Lionel Atwill\n- Products: Captain America (1943 film serial)\n- Companies: Republic Pictures\n- Concepts: superheroes, Marvel Comics\n\nFacts:\n- Dick Purcell was born on August 6, 1908, and died on April 10, 1944.\n- Dick Purcell was an American actor.\n- Dick Purcell was best known for playing Marvel Comics' Captain America in the 1943 film serial Captain America.\n- Lorna Gray and Lionel Atwill co-starred with Dick Purcell in the 1943 film serial Captain America.\n- Republic Pictures' Captain America was the last serial the company made about a superhero.",
